// Master placement for desert. Names come from rules/masters.def.
//
// Rhogan stands on the info_player_deathmatch at the north of the map with a
// radius wide enough to cover the spawn itself, so a player who spawns there is
// greeted without having to find him first - which is what makes the trigger
// verifiable in a smoke run. Oberak is out at the intermission viewpoint,
// far enough that reaching him is a flight.
//
// Rewrite this file with masterplace/mastersave rather than by hand; see the
// masterplace banner comment in Game/Game/g_training.c.

place  rhogan    -40810 4681 1486   768
place  oberak  -29790 -28265 6062  768
